Eddie's Curried Corn Salad - 4 July 2002

1 T fresh ginger finely chopped
1 T garlic ditto
3 t cooking oil
1-2 T curry powder
1/3 c honey
1/2 c mayo
1/2 c sour cream
1 red pepper roasted, peeled, sliced
1 red onion finely chopped
1/4 c mint finely chopped
1/4 c cilantro finely chopped
5 zucchini grilled & sliced
5 bags frozen corn

Saute garlic & ginger in cooking oil, then mix
in curry powder.  After 3-4 minutes add honey and
cool.  Add sour cream & mayo.  Warm corn.  Mix all
together.  Salt & pepper to taste.


Curry Powder:
2 T coriander
2 T cumin
1 T fenugreek
1 T fennel
1 T mustard
1 T cinnamon
few cloves
2 T turmeric (ground)
1 T dill seed
5-6 allspice seeds

Toast seeds which oughta be toasted, grind
all up and mix.

